<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · text</p><h1 class="enc-title">Bhagavadgomandal</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1944">1944</a>–<a href="/years/1955">1955</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Bhagavadgomandal is a Gujarati encyclopedia and dictionary compiled under the patronage of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maharaja">Maharaja</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bhagvatsinhji">Bhagvatsinhji of Gondal</a>. Work began in 1928, and it was published in nine volumes between 1944 and 1955. With some 281,000 word meanings, it remains the largest work of its kind in the Gujarati language.</p></div>
